      "body": "## Summary\n\n- Requests using `\"role\": \"developer\"` fail with a `ValidationError` when served with `--tokenizer-mode mistral` because `mistral-common` only accepts `system`/`user`/`assistant`/`tool` roles\n- The HF renderer already handles this with `_convert_developer_to_system()`, but the Mistral renderer passes messages through unchanged\n- Adds the same developer-to-system conversion in `MistralRenderer.render_messages()` and its async variant, applied before both `parse_chat_messages` and `apply_chat_template`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `test_convert_developer_to_system`: verifies the helper converts developer→system without mutating the original list\n- `test_developer_role_renders_with_mistral_tokenizer`: verifies the renderer applies the conversion before passing messages to the tokenizer\n\nFixes #64793",
